  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Indevelop har f&#xe5;tt i uppdrag att assistera ambassaden i operationaliseringsprocess vad g&#xe4;lller vissa uppgifter, s&#xe5;som att facilitera en f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsteori-workshop samt att assistera ambassaden i framtagande av en uppf&#xf6;ljnings/utv&#xe4;rderings plan f&#xf6;r ambassaden. Se kontrakt och ToR f&#xf6;r mer detaljerad information.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Develop Cooperation section within the Embassy of Sweden in Kampala is in the process of operationalising the results strategy 2014-2018. This process includes conducting a Theory of Change work shop including outcome mapping on strategy level as well as preparing plans for follow up and evaluation of results.

Sweden has decided to engage a consultant to perform certain services in connection with the operationalization of the results strategy.</narrative>
